      "title": "IPC & Single-Instance Safety",
      "items": [
        "agent-bridge enforces single instance via TCP lock on port 43224 and relays fs.watch events to main.js",
        "app.js unifies mouse hit-testing so only the active UI areas intercept mouse clicks, leaving other areas click-through"
